# Omarchy WSL — curated package list (default "minimal" profile)
#
# This is the terminal-focused subset of install/omarchy-base.packages that
# makes sense inside a WSL container: the Omarchy CLI tooling, shell experience,
# theming dependencies, editors, and developer tools. GUI desktop packages
# (Hyprland, SDDM, Plymouth, Chromium, LibreOffice, OBS, etc.) are intentionally
# omitted here — build with `--build-arg PROFILE=full` to install the complete
# install/omarchy-base.packages set instead.
#
# Every entry below also appears in install/omarchy-base.packages, so the WSL
# experience stays faithful to upstream Omarchy.

# --- Omarchy CLI requirements ---
gum
expac
usage

# --- Shell experience ---
bash-completion
starship
zoxide
fzf
fastfetch
tldr
mise

# --- Core CLI tools ---
bat
eza
fd
ripgrep
jq
less
man-db
plocate
unzip
whois
inetutils
socat
xmlstarlet
imagemagick
libqalculate
dua-cli
tmux
wl-clipboard
xdg-user-dirs
xdg-utils

# --- Editors ---
nvim
omarchy-nvim
tree-sitter-cli
luarocks

# --- Git / containers TUIs ---
github-cli
lazygit
lazydocker

# --- Developer toolchains (match omarchy-base.packages) ---
clang
llvm
rust
ruby

# --- Fonts for a faithful terminal ---
ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd
noto-fonts
noto-fonts-emoji

# --- System monitor ---
btop
